WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.418 --> 00:00:04.379
♪♪

00:00:04.379 --> 00:00:05.088
(Exhales)

00:00:05.088 --> 00:00:05.672
(Coughs)

00:00:05.672 --> 00:00:06.673
(Inhales)

00:00:06.673 --> 00:00:07.633
(Exhales)

00:00:07.674 --> 00:00:10.093
(Gasping for air)

00:00:10.135 --> 00:00:15.599
♪♪

00:00:15.599 --> 00:00:17.226
Initiate re-entry.

00:00:17.935 --> 00:00:19.478
Computer:
Secure for re-entry.

00:00:19.853 --> 00:00:24.858
♪♪

00:00:24.983 --> 00:00:27.069
Gaal:
It was always a leap of faith.

00:00:27.110 --> 00:00:29.738
♪♪

00:00:29.738 --> 00:00:33.116
(Engine thrusts)

00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:36.828
Gaal:
Leaving the comfort of home.

00:00:36.870 --> 00:00:38.872
♪♪

00:00:38.956 --> 00:00:42.417
(Engine thrusts)

00:00:43.919 --> 00:00:45.462
Gaal:
Though the journey was long,

00:00:45.587 --> 00:00:50.509
♪♪

00:00:51.551 --> 00:00:53.262
Gaal:
the mission of the Foundation,

00:00:55.055 --> 00:00:56.556
Gaal:
had only just begun.

00:00:58.809 --> 00:01:00.477
♪♪

00:01:03.146 --> 00:01:04.898
Gaal:
There's a new crisis

00:01:05.274 --> 00:01:07.192
♪♪

00:01:08.151 --> 00:01:09.653
Gaal:
right on our doorstep.

00:01:09.945 --> 00:01:11.738
♪♪

00:01:11.738 --> 00:01:13.699
Hari:
If there is war,

00:01:13.699 --> 00:01:16.618
♪♪

00:01:16.618 --> 00:01:17.661
Hari:
we will win.

00:01:17.703 --> 00:01:23.375
♪♪

00:01:23.375 --> 00:01:24.251
Now!

00:01:24.251 --> 00:01:27.004
♪♪

00:01:27.004 --> 00:01:28.046
(Growl)

00:01:30.257 --> 00:01:49.151
♪♪

